// Signing configuration shared by every target (the project-level base
// configuration for Debug and Release).
//
// Don't put a team ID in this file. Copy Config/Local.xcconfig.example to
// Config/Local.xcconfig, which is gitignored, and set DEVELOPMENT_TEAM there.
// You can also pass DEVELOPMENT_TEAM=YOURTEAMID to xcodebuild. Five scripts
// read the same file through Support/team-id-lib.sh:
// Support/build-serberusd-bundle.sh, Support/serberusd-devtool.sh, and
// PKG/build-commander-pkg.sh, build-sentinel-app-pkg.sh and
// build-authuribrowser-pkg.sh. build-pkg.sh and build-combined-pkg.sh reach
// it only through the scripts they call; the other build scripts don't read it.

#include? "Local.xcconfig"
